 "text": "Hi! How are you doing these days? That' a great idea. How far is the ride, and do you want to do it all in one go, or mix it with public transport? It means you can stop and pick up where you left off, even across days. It' useful for big rides especially if weather stops you. So, are you going to mix public transport with your bike ride, or do the entire thing on two wheels? You can usually find quieter route, often along canal or footpaths. It might take bit longer, but it' worth it for the peace and quiet.",
